OL,3,ALondon housing project wins top
OL,4,Aarchitecture award
OL,5,
OL,6,FReplacing a former car park on a
OL,7,Fchallenging, sloping site that varies
OL,8,Fin height by eight metres (26ft), Riba
OL,9,Fpresident Chris Williamson praised the
OL,10,Fdesign as a "new approach to higher
OL,11,Fdensity development" creating "a new
OL,12,Fconnection between the bustling Lion
OL,13,FGreen Road and a distinctive area of
OL,14,Fgreen parkland beyond".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/17
