OL,5,G1445 Life Without
OL,6,     FA tiny bat can eat 2,000 insects a
OL,7,     Fnight. Alan Davies imagines a
OL,8,     Fworld without bats and asks what
OL,9,     Fhappens to our food, forests and
OL,10,     Feven the tequila in our glasses?
